---
import ProductWindow from "~/components/ProductWindow.astro";
---

<section class="organization" aria-labelledby="organization-title">
  <div class="shell organization__inner">
    <header class="organization__head" data-appear>
      <span class="eyebrow">
        <span data-lang="en">02 · Organize</span>
        <span data-lang="fr">02 · Organiser</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="organization-title">
        <span data-lang="en">The day on one side. The week on the other.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr">Le jour d’un côté. La semaine de l’autre.</span>
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="organization__copy" data-appear>
      <p>
        <span data-lang="en">Set priorities for today or tomorrow. Repeat what needs to become routine. Then give each important block a real place in the week.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr">Pose les priorités d’aujourd’hui ou de demain. Répète ce qui doit devenir une habitude. Puis donne une vraie place aux blocs importants dans la semaine.</span>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><span data-lang="en">Today and tomorrow views</span><span data-lang="fr">Vues aujourd’hui et demain</span></li>
        <li><span data-lang="en">Priorities and daily repetition</span><span data-lang="fr">Priorités et répétition quotidienne</span></li>
        <li><span data-lang="en">Reusable weekly schedule</span><span data-lang="fr">Planning hebdomadaire réutilisable</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="organization__scene" data-appear>
      <div class="organization__tasks">
        <ProductWindow
          src="/screenshots/tasks.png"
          altEn="Manager Tasks screen with five realistic tasks, completion progress, priorities and recurring tasks."
          altFr="Écran Tâches de Manager avec cinq tâches, la progression, les priorités et une tâche récurrente."
        />
      </div>
      <div class="organization__schedule">
        <ProductWindow
          src="/screenshots/schedule.png"
          altEn="Manager weekly Schedule screen with coloured work blocks arranged through the day."
          altFr="Planning hebdomadaire de Manager avec des blocs de travail colorés répartis dans la journée."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .organization { padding: var(--section-space) 0; overflow: clip; }

  .organization__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(18rem, 0.65fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .organization__copy { padding-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .organization__copy p { color: var(--mute); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.65; }

  .organization__copy ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
  }

  .organization__copy li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--ink-warm);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .organization__copy li::before {
    content: "";
    width: 0.35rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.22rem var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .organization__scene {
    position: relative;
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    min-height: clamp(32rem, 64vw, 56rem);
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .organization__tasks { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: min(76%, 60rem); }
  .organization__schedule { position: absolute; right: -4%; bottom: 0; width: min(72%, 58rem); }
  .organization__schedule :global(.product-window) { box-shadow: -2rem 2rem 6rem rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55); }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .organization__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .organization__scene { grid-column: auto; display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; min-height: 0; margin-top: 0; }
    .organization__tasks, .organization__schedule { position: relative; inset: auto; width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
